  m_Name: Hero_Torbin_1Star
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: EndlessPull.Runtime::HeroData
  heroName: Torbin
  title: Cuero y Correa
  origin: Marca Quemada
  bio: Curte cuero para monturas y petos; huele siempre a humo y sebo.
  bioEn: He tans leather for saddles and breastplates; he always smells of smoke
    and tallow.
  bioJa: "\u978D\u3084\u80F8\u5F53\u3066\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u9769\u3092\u306A\u3081\u3059\u3002\u3044\u3064\u3082\u7159\u3068\u7363\u8102\u306E\u5302\u3044\u304C\u3059\u308B\u3002"
  memories:
  - starRank: 0
    unlock: 4
    amount: 1
    text: "El olor a sebo se le metió tan hondo en la ropa que ya ni el humo de la Torre lo tapa."
    textEn: "The smell of tallow soaked so deep into his clothes that not even the Tower's smoke can cover it."
    textJa: "獣脂の匂いは服に染み込みすぎて、塔の煙でさえ消すことができない。"
